      `the harmonisation facts` IS A `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts`
      `the provider is implementing the risk management system as provided for in paragraphs 1 to 7` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 9(9) act`
`Art 9(9) the provider's duty to give consideration to the adverse impact on persons under the age of 18 and other vulnerable groups` MEANS
